&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_10838ec6a95bc2d4-72&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a detail-oriented, strategic team player to join as a Benefits Manager on Asana’s People Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will design and scale foundational benefits programs that drive consistency, well-being, and equity across our North America organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4&quot;&gt;. You will own key offerings, including health &amp;amp; welfare benefits, wellness, and retirement, ensuring every Asana has access to comprehensive, competi&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5347 citation-end-5347&quot;&gt;tive support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5346 citation-end-5346&quot;&gt;. The People Team at Asana works to enable all Asanas to achieve our goals as a company in a way that is consistent with our values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5345 citation-end-5345&quot;&gt;. We focus on recruiting, developing, and retaining exceptional talent from diverse backgrounds, ensuring that eve&lt;/span&gt;ryone can thrive, grow, and make a meaningful impact in support of Asana&#39;s broader mission: to help humanity thrive by enabling all teams to collaborate seamlessly and eff&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5343 citation-5344 citation-end-5344&quot;&gt;ectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,10&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5341 citation-5342 citation-end-5342&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
