node=&quot;6,6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10993 citation-end-10993&quot;&gt;. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with &lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;which you partner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,8&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,9&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,10&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
