&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;LinkThemeablePresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation--sentimentSelected PrimaryLink HighlightSol HighlightSol--core HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gem.com/form?formID=fbcdec8c-3442-43b9-9b45-d2b5f4ea25db&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Join Asana’s Talent Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to stay up to date on job opportunities and life at Asana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e8b36cc4544c3a29-189&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As the CX Technical Enablement Partner, you will serve as the dedicated enablement partner for Asana’s Support and Professional Services teams and lead technical training development across Customer Experience. In this role, you will diagnose technical capability gaps and design, build, and deliver high-impact learning programs to close them. Combining strategic advisory (roughly 40%) with hands-on curriculum and content creation (roughly 60%), you will also develop the technical depth Customer Success Managers need to drive adoption, retention, and consumption growth. Reporting to the Head of CX Enablement, you will be an integral member of a focused enablement team accelerating cust&lt;span class=&quot;citation-11000 citation-11001 citation-end-11001&quot;&gt;omer and team readiness across Asana and AI workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e8b36cc4544c3a29-133&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10998 citation-10999 citation-end-10999&quot;&gt;This role is based in our Dublin office with an office-centric hybrid schedule&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10996 citation-10997 citation-end-10997&quot;&gt;. The standard in-office days are Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10994 citation-10995 citation-end-10995&quot;&gt;. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10994 citation-end-10994&quot;&gt;Wednesdays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10993 citation-end-10993&quot;&gt;. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with &lt;/span&gt;which you partner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,8&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,10&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Act as the primary enablement strategic partner for Support and Professional Services leadership, conducting recurring needs assessments to translate business goals into prioritized enablement roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Own and prioritize the Support and Services CX enablement roadmap, managing intake requests and establishing clear metrics to measure training effectiveness and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Design, build, and deliver technical curricula, including product architecture, administrative configuration, demo workflows, APIs/integrations, and troubleshooting frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Develop engaging digital content, eLearning modules, and live training sessions adhering to instructional design standards and frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Build and scale technical certification programs for Support, Services, and Customer Success teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;Partner closely with the AI Product Enablement lead to ensure organizational readiness for new product capabilities and enterprise AI feature rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;Author and curate technical artifacts and documentation to maintain a centralized, up-to-date knowledge base across Customer Experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
