&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;Proven track record in technical enablement, instructional design, or customer-facing technical roles (such as Support, Professional Services, Solutions Engineering, or Implementation) with a dedicated training focus.&lt;/p&gt;
