&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;Deep technical acumen with the ability to quickly master complex SaaS concepts, including platform administration, data flows, APIs, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;Experience building or managing role-based technical certification and credentialing programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e8b36cc4544c3a29-190&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,6,0&quot;&gt;Strong self-starter with t&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10992 citation-end-10992&quot;&gt;he ability to manage an independent roadmap, balance strategic alignment with content execution, and leverage modern digital enablement tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
