&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9f11a9c769dfd22c-98&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0&quot;&gt;These are just some of the benefits we offer, and benefits may vary based on role, country, and local regulations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9f11a9c769dfd22c-99&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Asana is a leading platform for human + AI collaboration. Millions of teams around the world rely on Asana to achieve their most important goals, faster. Asana has been named to Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces for 7+ years and recognized by Fast Company, Forbes, and Gartner for excellence in workplace culture and innovation. We offer an exceptional office-centric culture while adopting the best elements of hybrid models to ensure that every one of our global team members can work together effortlessly. With 13+ offices all over the world, we are always looking for individuals who care about building technology that drives positive change in the world and a culture where everyone feels that they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation_31345133_root TypographyPresentation_31345133_root--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol_1625403506_highlightSol HighlightSol_1625403506_buildingBlock&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive. Our goal is to ensure that Asana upholds an environment where all people feel that they are respected and valued, whether they are applying for an open position or working at the company. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;LinkThemeablePresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation--sentimentSelected PrimaryLink HighlightSol HighlightSol--core HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gem.com/form?formID=fbcdec8c-3442-43b9-9b45-d2b5f4ea25db&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Join Asana’s Talent Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to stay up to date on job opportunities and life at Asana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1 data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;Design Leader, Emerging Products (Asana Service Management &amp;amp; Command by Asana)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-304&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot;&gt;Asana Design is an inclusive and collaborative community of designers from diverse backgrounds dedicated to designing the future of teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2&quot;&gt;. We are looking for a hands-on Design Leader to shape two of our emerging products: Asana Service Management and Command by Asana&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4&quot;&gt;. In this 0→1 leadership role, you will thrive in early-stage ambiguity, partner closely with product, engineering, and research leadership to define the product design vision, and personally craft experiences that drive product-market fit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6&quot;&gt;. You will also represent design in strategic forums with senior and executive leadership, driving outsized impact on compa&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6945 citation-6946 citation-end-6946&quot;&gt;ny-level investments and roadmaps&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6945 citation-end-6945&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6943 citation-6944 citation-end-6944&quot;&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6943 citation-end-6943&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-305&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6941 citation-6942 citation-end-6942&quot;&gt;This role is based in our San Francisco office with an office-centric hybrid schedule. The standard in-office days are Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6941 citation-end-6941&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6939 citation-6940 citation-end-6940&quot;&gt;. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on &lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6939 citation-end-6939&quot;&gt;Wednesdays&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-6938 citation-end-6938&quot;&gt;. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; which you partner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
