&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-306&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end design strategy and product vision across Asana Service Management and Command by Asana, driving directly toward product-market fit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-307&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Stay hands-on in the design craft, balancing speed and quality to determine when to iterate rapidly with prototypes and when to execute deep design investment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
