&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-309&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Experience Research to deeply understand and validate problem spaces across target IT, HR, and developer personas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-310&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Establish design quality bars and scalable patterns suited for early-stage 0→1 products while maintaining alignment with Asana’s overall design system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-311&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Represent design in reviews and strategic discussions with senior leadership and executives, providing a clear point of view to guide company-level decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-312&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with General Managers, Product Managers, and Engineering leads to align roadmaps with user needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
