&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0734c381941f8825-313&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrates curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
