&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute developer engagement strategies that drive adoption of Asana’s platform, APIs, and SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author high-quality technical content, including sample apps, code tutorials, technical blog posts, and API documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the developer community across forums, events, workshops, and social channels, serving as the primary advocate for developer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Management, Engineering, and Design to provide actionable developer feedback and help shape platform roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong cross-functional relationships with Marketing, Business Development, and Solutions Engineering to support partner integrations and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide junior advocates and community members, elevating advocacy best practices across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
