&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-44&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a driven and strategic Emerging Enterprise Account Executive to join our Emerging Enterprise sales team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2&quot;&gt;. In this role, you’ll deepen connections with key decision-makers, understand their evolving needs, and craft tailored, value-driven strategies to fuel customer success and unlock new growth opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4&quot;&gt;. As a trusted partner to clients and a critical contributor to our business, you will sharpen your sales expertise while making a meaningful impact across the organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-45&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot;&gt;This role is based in our San Francisco office with an office-centric hybrid schedule&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2&quot;&gt;. The standard in-office days are Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4&quot;&gt;. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on Wednesdays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6&quot;&gt;. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with which you partner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,8&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,10&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-46&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive revenue growth by expanding existing customer accounts through up-selling, cross-selling, and executing strong commercial strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle from prospecting and qualification to negotiation and closing for complex deals with multiple stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Leverage negotiation skills and data-driven insights to secure win-win strategic partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Define territory and account strategies that enable sales velocity in partnership with Sales Engineers, Sales Development Reps, Customer Success Managers, Professional Services, and Executive Sponsors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;Establish trust with C-level executives, IT decision-makers, and key stakeholders to align solutions with their strategic goals and expand usage across new teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;Develop a deep understanding of customer goals to uncover new use cases and drive incremental revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with marketing, product, and customer success teams to deliver a seamless customer experience and ensure successful adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,7,0&quot;&gt;Focus on value delivery to ensure customers realize measurable ROI, setting the stage for long-term partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-47&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-48&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrates curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;Minimum 3 years of experience in an Enterprise sales role and 5+ years in a B2B closing sales role (SaaS experience preferred).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;Proven track record of consistent quota attainment and delivering growth within existing Emerging Enterprise or Enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience in consultative selling, strategic account management, and navigating complex sales cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot;&gt;Strong ability to build trust and foster relationships with stakeholders across all levels, including C-suite executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot;&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a drive for continuous improvement, learning, and customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-49&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0&quot;&gt;At Asana, we&#39;re committed to building teams that include a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills, as this is critical to helping us achieve our mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interested in this role and don&#39;t meet every listed requirement, we still encourage you to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-50&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-51&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0&quot;&gt;Our comprehensive compensation package plays a big part in how we recognize you for the impact you have on our path to achieving our mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2&quot;&gt;. We believe that compensation should be reflective of the value you create relative to the market value of your role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4&quot;&gt;. To ensure pay is fair and not impacted by biases, we&#39;re committed to looking at market value which is why we check ourselves and conduct a yearly pay equity audit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;For this role, the On-Target Earnings (OTE) range will vary based on your location. Locations in the US are categorized into one of three geographic pay zones, and the ranges for the zones are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-asana-list=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zone A:&lt;/strong&gt; Total OTE $213,000 - $242,000 (includes a base salary range of $106,500 - $121,000 and performance-based sales incentive pay)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zone B:&lt;/strong&gt; Total OTE $192,000 - $218,000 (includes a base salary range of $96,000 - $109,000 and performance-based sales incentive pay)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zone C:&lt;/strong&gt; Total OTE $170,000 - $194,000 (includes a base salary range of $85,000 - $97,000 and performance-based sales incentive pay)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about which locations fall into each pay zone, please visit &lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://asana.com/usa-pay-zones&quot;&gt;https://asana.com/usa-pay-zones&lt;/a&gt;. Please also consult your recruiter to confirm the applicable pay zone for your specific location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-53&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0&quot;&gt;In addition, your compensation package may include additional components such as equity and benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-54&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0&quot;&gt;We strive to provide equitable and competitive benefits packages that support our employees worldwide and include&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;19,2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-55&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Mental health, wellness &amp;amp; fitness benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-56&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Career coaching &amp;amp; support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-57&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Inclusive family building benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-58&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Long-term savings or retirement plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-59&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;20,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;20,4,0,0&quot;&gt;In-office culinary options to cater to your dietary preferences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-60&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0&quot;&gt;These are just some of the benefits we offer, and benefits may vary based on role, country, and local regulations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_536c33b947ceb98e-61&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Asana is a leading platform for human + AI collaboration. Millions of teams around the world rely on Asana to achieve their most important goals, faster. Asana has been named to Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces for 7+ years and recognized by Fast Company, Forbes, and Gartner for excellence in workplace culture and innovation. We offer an exceptional office-centric culture while adopting the best elements of hybrid models to ensure that every one of our global team members can work together effortlessly. With 13+ offices all over the world, we are always looking for individuals who care about building technology that drives positive change in the world and a culture where everyone feels that they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation_31345133_root TypographyPresentation_31345133_root--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol_1625403506_highlightSol HighlightSol_1625403506_buildingBlock&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive. Our goal is to ensure that Asana upholds an environment where all people feel that they are respected and valued, whether they are applying for an open position or working at the company. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;LinkThemeablePresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation--sentimentSelected PrimaryLink HighlightSol HighlightSol--core HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gem.com/form?formID=fbcdec8c-3442-43b9-9b45-d2b5f4ea25db&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Join Asana’s Talent Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to stay up to date on job opportunities and life at Asana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Asana’s Impact Go-To-Market team is looking for a driven, customer-centric, and impact-oriented sales professional to join our dedicated team serving nonprofit organizations. In this role, you will focus on managing, landing, and expanding business within your assigned book of accounts while helping shape Asana’s broader go-to-market strategy across. You will partner cross-functionally and work with key channel partners to accelerate revenue growth, empower organizations, and deliver maximum value to our impact-focused customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our San Francisco, New York, or Chicago office with an office-centric hybrid schedule. The standard in-office days are Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on Wednesdays. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with which you partner. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll achieve&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div data-asana-list=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively manage a portfolio of nonprofit customers, serving as their main point of contact and driving revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define territory and account strategies that enable sales velocity in partnership with Sales Engineers, Sales Development Reps, Customer Success Managers, Deal Desk, Professional Services, and Executive Sponsors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Navigate enterprise accounts to map key stakeholders, cultivate champions, and build strong relationships with C-level decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consistently meet and exceed targets with support from a collaborative sales enablement team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div data-asana-list=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrates curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4+ years selling directly into the emerging enterprise segment, with 6+ years of total experience closing business in a rapidly scaling software environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior experience selling into the public sector, education, or impact-focused industries, or direct familiarity with the nonprofit sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of generating revenue and co-selling alongside channel partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to build relationships with senior line-of-business and IT executives within large organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer-centric approach to relationship building, with a history of developing C-suite and Director-level champions that result in enterprise-wide adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adaptable, entrepreneurial, and solution-oriented mindset with a commitment to co-creating alongside cross-functional partners in a diverse and inclusive workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent prioritization skills with the ability to manage a diverse account portfolio and lead cross-functional support teams effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Asana, we&#39;re committed to building teams that include a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills, as this is critical to helping us achieve our mission. If you&#39;re interested in this role and don&#39;t meet every listed requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’ll offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive compensation package plays a big part in how we recognize you for the impact you have on our path to achieving our mission. We believe that compensation should be reflective of the value you create relative to the market value of your role. To ensure pay is fair and not impacted by biases, we&#39;re committed to looking at market value which is why we check ourselves and conduct a yearly pay equity audit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this role, the On-Target Earnings (OTE) range will vary based on your location. Locations in the US are categorized into one of three geographic pay zones, and the ranges for the zones are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-asana-list=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zone A:&lt;/strong&gt; Total OTE $247,000 - $281,000 (includes a base salary range of $123,500 - $140,500 and performance-based sales incentive pay)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zone B:&lt;/strong&gt; Total OTE $222,000 - $253,000 (includes a base salary range of $111,000 - $126,500 and performance-based sales incentive pay)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zone C:&lt;/strong&gt; Total OTE $202,000 - $230,000 (includes a base salary range of $101,000 - $115,000 and performance-based sales incentive pay)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about which locations fall into each pay zone, please visit &lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://asana.com/usa-pay-zones&quot;&gt;https://asana.com/usa-pay-zones&lt;/a&gt;. Please also consult your recruiter to confirm the applicable pay zone for your specific location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, your compensation package may include additional components such as equity and benefits. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to provide equitable and competitive benefits packages that support our employees worldwide and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-asana-list=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health, wellness &amp;amp; fitness benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career coaching &amp;amp; support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inclusive family building benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Long-term savings or retirement plans&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In-office culinary options to cater to your dietary preferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
