&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor with excellent relationship-building skills from C-level to end-users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
