&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience closing deals and building strategic relationships within State, Local Government, and Higher Education (SLED) verticals (a focus on the Pacific Northwest Region is a plus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to close deals with consistently high quota attainment, particularly within the Enterprise SaaS space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skill in uncovering hidden potential within established enterprise accounts to drive exponential growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellence at cultivating trust and fostering long-term partnerships with diverse stakeholders with a bias toward action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Asana, we&#39;re committed to building teams that include a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills, as this is critical to helping us achieve our mission. If you&#39;re interested in this role and don&#39;t meet every listed requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’ll offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive compensation package plays a big part in how we recognize you for the impact you have on our path to achieving our mission. We believe that compensation should be reflective of the value you create relative to the market value of your role. To ensure pay is fair and not impacted by biases, we&#39;re committed to looking at market value which is why we check ourselves and conduct a yearly pay equity audit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this role, the On-Target Earnings (OTE) range is $290,000 - $330,000. The total OTE includes a base salary range of $145,000 - $165,000 and performance-based sales incentive pay (based on the terms of the Sales Incentive Plan). These ranges are a guideline; actual base salary and OTE may vary based on various factors, including market and individual qualifications objectively assessed during the interview process, and the ranges for this role may be modified.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, your compensation package may include additional components such as equity and benefits. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to provide equitable and competitive benefits packages that support our employees worldwide and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-asana-list=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health, wellness &amp;amp; fitness benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career coaching &amp;amp; support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inclusive family building benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Long-term savings or retirement plans&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In-office culinary options to cater to your dietary preferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These are just some of the benefits we offer, and benefits may vary based on role, country, and local regulations. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Asana is a leading platform for human + AI collaboration. Millions of teams around the world rely on Asana to achieve their most important goals, faster. Asana has been named to Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces for 7+ years and recognized by Fast Company, Forbes, and Gartner for excellence in workplace culture and innovation. We offer an exceptional office-centric culture while adopting the best elements of hybrid models to ensure that every one of our global team members can work together effortlessly. With 13+ offices all over the world, we are always looking for individuals who care about building technology that drives positive change in the world and a culture where everyone feels that they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation_31345133_root TypographyPresentation_31345133_root--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol_1625403506_highlightSol HighlightSol_1625403506_buildingBlock&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive. Our goal is to ensure that Asana upholds an environment where all people feel that they are respected and valued, whether they are applying for an open position or working at the company. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;LinkThemeablePresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation--sentimentSelected PrimaryLink HighlightSol HighlightSol--core HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gem.com/form?formID=fbcdec8c-3442-43b9-9b45-d2b5f4ea25db&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Join Asana’s Talent Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to stay up to date on job opportunities and life at Asana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Our work informs teams at every level of Asana and drives key roadmap decisions. We partner with Product Design, Product Management, Data Science, and Engineering, as well as business and marketing teams, to develop valuable insights about customer behaviors and attitudes, translating them into actionable recommendations. We think deeply about new areas, help develop and test concepts, and improve products and services once they’ve rolled out. As a Senior Experience Researcher, you will be a strategic partner who not only executes high-impact research but also shapes the research culture to elevate our collective craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our &lt;strong&gt;Vancouver&lt;/strong&gt; office. Day to day collaboration is split roughly 50/50 between Vancouver teammates and San Francisco teammates. Locally, you will work closely with our PLG Adoption teams, specifically partnering with the AI Activations (AIA) and Conversion and Retention (CoRe) teams. Key local partners include Product Managers, Designers, and Engineering leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate with an office-centric hybrid schedule. In-office days are Monday, Tuesday and Thursday. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on Wednesdays. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with which you partner. If you interview for this role, your recruiter will share more about in-office requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will help shape and scale Asana’s Product-Led Growth (PLG) self-serve business. We recently launched several major new products—including AI Teammates, a Meetings product, and Asana for Client Management (ACM). We are also preparing two more major product lines for launch, which will unlock entirely new workflows and use cases for our customers.&amp;nbsp; Historically, our growth relied on selling more seats or moving customers to higher tiers. Now, we have multiple new growth vectors, from AI credit consumption to these brand new product offerings. You will play a pivotal role in uncovering how to introduce users to these products, encourage users to try them, adopt them into their daily workflows, and deepen their usage over time.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Experience Researcher plays a key role in defining the product roadmap and influencing how our PLG adoption strategy evolves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first 4-5 months, you will partner with Adoption teams on immediate Q4 roadmap priorities, building out the self-serve pathways to buy and adopt our newest products. Over time, your remit will expand as we roll out self-serve motions for additional products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a strategic partner: Together with your cross-functional partners (Product, Design, Engineering, Data Science) you’ll uncover how to best introduce users to Asana’s new products, encourage users to try them out, drive adoption in daily workflows, and deepen usage over time.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive ACM self serve growth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research how users discover Asana for Client Management (ACM), start using it, adopt advanced features, and expand its footprint across their organization.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncover opportunities and pathways for how AI teammates, the Meetings product, and the client portal help customers extract more value from ACM and invite cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead research on new concepts: Lead research on new concepts: Drive exploratory and evaluative research for upcoming product additions, assessing whether new concepts and personalized experiences feel valuable enough to encourage user engagement and organic sharing.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a foundation for future PLG offerings: Identify high-impact research needs to support the self-serve rollouts for the next two major product launches.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect insights to business impact: Ensure research directly influences the roadmap to meet critical business metrics, supporting our goals for AI ARR growth, higher-LTV customers, and increased NRR.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; practicing UX Research for digital products, with a proven track record of leading large-scale projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong proficiency in mixed-methods research&lt;/strong&gt;, seamlessly combining qualitative deep-dives (contextual inquiry, prototype testing) with quantitative validation (survey design, behavioral data analysis) to triangulate insights and build high-confidence recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mature product judgement&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to distill messy signal into clear, &quot;low-polish&quot; deliverables that drive immediate decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong organizational leadership&lt;/strong&gt; and the ability to manage multiple complex workstreams while building deep trust and rapport with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding of interaction design and content hierarchy, &lt;/strong&gt;allowing you to partner effectively with Design and Content Strategy to reduce friction and drive user action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persuasive communicator&lt;/strong&gt; who can influence product strategy through storytelling and evidence-based recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Actively experimenting with AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making. We’re looking for researchers who can harness AI to extend and deepen the ways in which we develop insights and leverage them across the org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’ll offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive compensation package plays a big part in how we recognize you for the impact you have on our path to achieving our mission. We believe that compensation should be reflective of the value you create relative to the market value of your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated Base Salary Range:&lt;/strong&gt; $132,000- $178,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity and Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Compensation includes equity and a comprehensive benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Mental health, wellness &amp;amp; fitness benefits, and inclusive family-building support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Career coaching and professional development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culinary:&lt;/strong&gt; In-office culinary options tailored to your dietary preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future:&lt;/strong&gt; Long-term savings and retirement plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
