erscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-4098 citation-end-4098&quot;&gt;on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with which you partner&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-4097 citation-end-4097&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re i&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;nterviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,10&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
