&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Head of Web Strategy &amp;amp; Services to join our team in Vancouver and own asana.com as our front door and as a measurable driver of web conversion and sales pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2&quot;&gt;. The Asana Marketing team is responsible for fueling business growth and building a brand customers love, partnering across the business to create a holistic digital strategy that ensures our website looks, performs, and drives measurable results in telling Asana’s story to the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will set the strategy for how key personas discover, understand, and navigate the site, while leading web strategy, localization, web platform (CMS), &lt;span class=&quot;citation-13133 citation-13134 citation-end-13134&quot;&gt;and the engineering capacity that brings it to life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13131 citation-13132 citation-end-13132&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
