&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Build and prioritize the global web roadmap by synthesizing user research, analytics, experimentation, and cross-functional stakeholder input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
