&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Oversee the web platform (CMS) architecture and roadmap, optimizing site performance, reliability, Core Web Vitals, and operational costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
