&lt;h1 class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13093 citation-13094 citation-13095 citation-end-13095&quot;&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13093 citation-13094 citation-end-13094&quot;&gt;hat we’ll offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13091 citation-13092 citation-end-13092&quot;&gt;Our comp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13091 citation-end-13091&quot;&gt;rehensive compensation package plays a big part in how we reco&lt;/span&gt;gnize you fo&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13090 citation-end-13090&quot;&gt;r the impact you have on our path to achieving our mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13089 citation-end-13089&quot;&gt;. We believe that compensation should be reflective of the value you create relative to the market value of your role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13088 citation-end-13088&quot;&gt;. To ensure pay is fair and not impact&lt;/span&gt;ed by biases, we&#39;re committed to looking at market value which is why we check ourselves and conduct a yearly pay equity audit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0&quot;&gt;For this role, the estimated base salary range is between $210,000 -$250,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13087 citation-end-13087&quot;&gt;. The actual base salary will vary based on various factors, including market and individual qualifications objectively assessed during the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13086 citation-end-13086&quot;&gt;. The listed range above is a guideline, and the base &lt;/span&gt;salary range for this role may be modified&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13,6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13085 citation-end-13085&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13084 citation-end-13084&quot;&gt;In addition to base salary, your compensation package may include additional components such as equity, sales incentive pay (for most sales roles), and benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-13083 citation-end-13083&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak&lt;/span&gt; with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;14,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;We strive to provide equitable and competitive benefits packages that support our employees worldwide and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Mental health, wellness &amp;amp; fitness benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Career coaching &amp;amp; support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Inclusive family building benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Long-term savings or retirement plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0,0&quot;&gt;In-office culinary options to cater to your dietary preferences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0&quot;&gt;These are just some of the benefits we offer, and benefits may vary based on role, country, and local regulations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Asana is a leading platform for human + AI collaboration. Millions of teams around the world rely on Asana to achieve their most important goals, faster. Asana has been named to Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces for 7+ years and recognized by Fast Company, Forbes, and Gartner for excellence in workplace culture and innovation. We offer an exceptional office-centric culture while adopting the best elements of hybrid models to ensure that every one of our global team members can work together effortlessly. With 13+ offices all over the world, we are always looking for individuals who care about building technology that drives positive change in the world and a culture where everyone feels that they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation_31345133_root TypographyPresentation_31345133_root--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol_1625403506_highlightSol HighlightSol_1625403506_buildingBlock&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive. Our goal is to ensure that Asana upholds an environment where all people feel that they are respected and valued, whether they are applying for an open position or working at the company. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;LinkThemeablePresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation--sentimentSelected PrimaryLink HighlightSol HighlightSol--core HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gem.com/form?formID=fbcdec8c-3442-43b9-9b45-d2b5f4ea25db&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Join Asana’s Talent Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to stay up to date on job opportunities and life at Asana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As Asana transitions from Collaborative Work Management (CWM) to Agentic Workflow Management (AWM), you will lead enterprise customers through that same transformation — helping them define what AI-powered work looks like for their organization, aligning stakeholders around a shared adoption plan, and driving measurable impact across their highest-value workflows. You will design and lead structured, time-bound engagements from onboarding through workflow launch, guiding teams and AI agents to execute work together seamlessly. Partnering closely with executive sponsors and frontline teams, you will navigate ambiguity, create operational clarity, and connect AI capabilities directly to meaningful business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_775d247996b09410-74&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5000 citation-5001 citation-5002 citation-end-5002&quot;&gt;This role is based in our London office with an office-centric hybrid schedule. The standard in-office days are Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on Wedne&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5000 citation-5001 citation-end-5001&quot;&gt;sdays. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with which you partner. If you&#39;re&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5000 citation-end-5000&quot;&gt; interviewing for&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead structured onboarding and deployment engagements in partnership with Customer Success, Sales, Solutions, and R&amp;amp;D to drive adoption of Asana AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Align enterprise stakeholders on platform setup, workflow priorities, and shared success metrics while assessing workflow complexity to deliver early impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Document and hand off comprehensive implementation plans, capturing prioritized workflows, mitigation strategies for known risks, and clear milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Guide customers end-to-end through workflow design, discovery, process mapping, configuration, and user acceptance testing with embedded Asana AI capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Coordinate cross-functional delivery across time-bound engagements, aligning workflow owners, IT, and business stakeholders from kickoff through training and launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;Develop documentation and forward-looking roadmaps that define how customers scale Asana AI usage, including expansion recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;Conduct recurring customer check-ins alongside account teams to assess workflow performance, adoption metrics, and identify new implementation opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,7,0&quot;&gt;Surface expansion signals to internal partners and establish repeatable delivery frameworks and best practices across the implementation team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
