&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Proven customer-facing implementation or consulting experience leading structured onboarding or deployment engagements within a SaaS company or consulting firm.&lt;/p&gt;
