&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in product design, with a portfolio that demonstrates strong thinking, craft, and iteration across onboarding, growth, or AI-powered product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prototyping skills and a maker mindset. You use prototypes regularly to explore ideas, test concepts, and drive collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited by highly collaborative product development and comfortable working closely with PMs and engineers throughout ideation and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity, moving quickly, and balancing incremental optimization work with longer-term product exploration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional visual and interaction design craft, with the ability to create polished, intuitive, and high-quality product experiences across every stage of the user journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design of end-to-end experiences for&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.asana.com/category/product/&quot;&gt; Asana products and features&lt;/a&gt;, with an emphasis on features for billing owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners to identify customer problems, establish vision, set strategy, build and ship solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion product excellence. Elevate the quality bar for our experience and shape our payment design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the organization to ship experiences that are cohesive with the broader Asana product experience, ensuring your design scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and role model human-centered problem solving. Foster co-creation across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn new methods to solve deeply complex problems in the service of inventing new ways to deliver our customer benefits: flow, efficiency, engagement, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape a product that is intuitive and elegant, which speaks from a unified voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
