&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_bc712d3961b612c7-62&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Revenue Manager to support our global revenue accounting functions and collaborate with cross-functional teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2&quot;&gt;. You will partner closely with Revenue Operations (Billings &amp;amp; Collections), Deal Desk, Business Technology, FP&amp;amp;A, Legal, Investor Relations, Sales, and other key stakeholders to influence and drive results for a wide array of business initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will oversee revenue recognition, contract reviews, and automation projects while supporting the maintenance of global revenue accounting policies and procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6&quot;&gt;. As part of our Finance team, you will contribute to the month-end close process, quarterly filings, and ad hoc requests, bringing technical ability and critical thinking to bridge the gap between operations, controls, and regulatory co&lt;span class=&quot;citation-4138 citation-4139 citation-end-4139&quot;&gt;mpliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-4136 citation-4137 citation-end-4137&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
