&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,4&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Asana is a leading platform for human + AI collaboration. Millions of teams around the world rely on Asana to achieve their most important goals, faster. Asana has been named to Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces for 7+ years and recognized by Fast Company, Forbes, and Gartner for excellence in workplace culture and innovation. We offer an exceptional office-centric culture while adopting the best elements of hybrid models to ensure that every one of our global team members can work together effortlessly. With 13+ offices all over the world, we are always looking for individuals who care about building technology that drives positive change in the world and a culture where everyone feels that they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation_31345133_root TypographyPresentation_31345133_root--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol_1625403506_highlightSol HighlightSol_1625403506_buildingBlock&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive. Our goal is to ensure that Asana upholds an environment where all people feel that they are respected and valued, whether they are applying for an open position or working at the company. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;LinkThemeablePresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation--sentimentSelected PrimaryLink HighlightSol HighlightSol--core HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gem.com/form?formID=fbcdec8c-3442-43b9-9b45-d2b5f4ea25db&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Join Asana’s Talent Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to stay up to date on job opportunities and life at Asana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_339b5158cfb28a7b-22&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a consultant who thrives at the intersection of process design, cross-functional coordination, and customer outcomes to guide enterprise customers through their transition to Agentic Workflow Management (AWM). In this role, you will help customers define what AI-powered work looks like for their organization, aligning stakeholders around a shared adoption plan and driving measurable impact across their highest-value workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2&quot;&gt;. You will design and lead structured, time-bound engagements from onboarding through workflow launch, moving customers to a platform where teams and agents execute work together. Engaging both executive stakeholders and front-line teams, you will operate with strong judgment in ambiguous environments to connect AI capabilities directly to meani&lt;span class=&quot;citation-12281 citation-12282 citation-end-12282&quot;&gt;ngful business results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-12279 citation-12280 citation-end-12280&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_339b5158cfb28a7b-23&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;This role can either be fully remote depending on which US state you live in, or based in our San Francisco office with an office-centric hybrid schedule. If based in-office: The standard in-office days are Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on Wednesdays. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with which you partner. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;What you’ll achieve&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_339b5158cfb28a7b-24&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead structured onboarding engagements by aligning customer stakeholders on platform setup, workflow priorities, and shared success metrics while assessing workflow complexity to target high-impact Asana AI opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Document and transition clear implementation plans that capture prioritized workflows, risk mitigation strategies, and next steps to ensure seamless execution and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Guide customers end-to-end through process mapping, hands-on workflow configuration, and user acceptance testing to deliver production-ready workflows with embedded Asana AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Coordinate cross-functional delivery across time-bound engagements, aligning workflow owners, IT, business stakeholders, and end users through kickoff, enablement, and launch milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Develop deployment roadmaps and forward-looking documentation that define how customers scale Asana AI usage, optimize adoption, and expand use cases over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;Lead recurring operational check-ins with customer account teams to monitor workflow performance, surface user pain points, and unlock new AI adoption opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_339b5158cfb28a7b-25&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Customer Success, Sales, and R&amp;amp;D to surface expansion signals, represent the voice of the customer internally, and translate account momentum into business growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,7,0&quot;&gt;Build repeatable frameworks and engagement processes that bring operational consistency to delivery motions across a portfolio of enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
