&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_d43766e494550528-467&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0&quot;&gt;In addition to base &lt;span class=&quot;citation-26053 citation-end-26053&quot;&gt;salary, your compensation package may include additional components such as equity, sales incentive pay (for most sales roles), and benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-26052 citation-end-26052&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more a&lt;/span&gt;bout the total compensation and benefits for this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_d43766e494550528-468&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;We strive to provide equitable and competitive benefits packages that support our employees worldwide and include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
