&lt;h1 data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;Senior Product Marketing Manager, Marketing &amp;amp; Operations Audiences&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_1636558c219d46fd-339&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot;&gt;The Asana Product Marketing team fuels business growth and builds a brand customers love by creating campaigns and content to attract new accounts and inspire current ones to grow with us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2&quot;&gt;. We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Marketing Manager to join our Solutions and Audience Marketing team in Vancouver to own how Asana shows up to Marketing and Operations leaders and practitioners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will go deep on these buyers and their daily workflows, turning that knowledge into messaging, field-enablement assets, and net-new acquisition campaigns that expand our pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6&quot;&gt;. You will also own the narrative for innovative capabilities like Agentic Work Management, partnering close&lt;span class=&quot;citation-18250 citation-18251 citation-end-18251&quot;&gt;ly with Core PMM, Product, and Sales teams&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-18250 citation-end-18250&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-18248 citation-18249 citation-end-18249&quot;&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-18248 citation-end-18248&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
