&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of software engineering experience, ideally backend- or infrastructure-focused, working in large, well-maintained codebases and shipping production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with build tooling and automated testing, with an interest in distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn quickly and transition seamlessly between different areas of a complex codebase and infrastructure stack.&lt;/li&gt;
