&lt;li&gt;Experience building developer tools, internal platforms, infrastructure, IDE/editor integrations, CLIs, or workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted development tools (such as Cursor, Claude Code, or Codex), or extending coding agents, MCP-based integrations, AI-powered code review systems, or agent skill/tool ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
